{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2019-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1550793600, "end_date": 1551398399, "month_true_total": 550, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:09:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49286732", "author": {"steamid": "76561198285657488", "personaname": "CooteMasterSack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IsaacC13/", "num_games_owned": 76, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 17978, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10433, "last_played": 1730168506, "avatar": "21a564397583cd1c581ff1f6f4110a9cf5a06291"}, "language": "english", "review": "Been with these devs sense their release back in 2000 of Operation Flashpoint - Cold War Crisis, and I must say that it is a one of a kind game. Like or dislike my simple review but these guys deserve a thumbs up and continuation of support from me even if that's all I can write at the time.", "timestamp_created": 1551397792, "timestamp_updated": 1551397792, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49286593", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960272801", "personaname": "Daimyo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DaimyoSexy/", "num_games_owned": 388, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 68330, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38252, "last_played": 1781407624, "avatar": "ff203c1d02e6b4fb4581fb8f63c029e325fd9f56"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just here to give my long love for Arma 3 and Bohemia Interactive.  Been an avid fan since I was 14-15 playing Operation Flashpoint on dial up ~2001.  One of the most consistent developers of our time that have literally help facilitate entire game genres from modders made developers with how open they have been to the modding community.", "timestamp_created": 1551396941, "timestamp_updated": 1551396941, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.535333991050720215", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49284968", "author": {"steamid": "76561198198423530", "personaname": "nayrino", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198198423530/", "num_games_owned": 222, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 847, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 295, "last_played": 1609279408, "avatar": "a521352ec938d97a89f4b9655f75924d3cea6344"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall, very good game.\n\nYes it has its draw backs, but I feel that they are more than made up for by its astounding qualities i.e. the vast and expansive landscape, and the choice in weapons and customisation.\n\nDon't buy if the only shooting games you have played are modern CODs or Battlefields, unless you are prepared to give up those beloved \"Quick-scopes\".\n\nThis is just my opiinion, do not get triggered.", "timestamp_created": 1551387505, "timestamp_updated": 1551387505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49284077", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114878820", "personaname": "Le Big Jesus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LeBigJesus/", "num_games_owned": 368, "num_reviews": 94, "playtime_forever": 5781, "playtime_last_two_